title: MilitarPhone
---
<<once>>
    <<declare $thirdwave = false>>
    Military: A-tten-tion! #line:S3-01-military
    Military: Good job soldier. #line:S3-02-military
    Military: But the battle is far from over! #line:S3-03-military
    Military: We brought one of our scientists in efforts to help you in your missions. #line:S3-04-military
    Military: To save your country and protect the government! #line:S3-05-military

    Scientist: Can I speak now? #line:S3-06-scientist
    Scientist: Anyway... #line:S3-07-scientist
    Scientist: So, we studied why your bread was so effective against the infected. #line:S3-08-scientist
    Scientist: And if seems they are intolerant to gliadin and glutenin! #line:S3-09-scientist
    Scientist: Unfortunately, while experimenting on them. #line:S3-10-scientist
    Scientist: They… let’s say… adapted. #line:S3-11-scientist

    <<spawn_new_recipe "military">>
    Scientist: So… to counter this #line:S3-12-scientist
    Scientist: We also designed a new weapon for you to use. #line:S3-13-scientist
    Scientist: A pastry bag. #line:S3-14-scientist
    Scientist: Seems fair after all we… *Static sound* Hey!! #line:S3-15-scientist

    Military: The next wave will be arriving soon. #line:S3-16-military
    Military: You must prepare keep fighting! #line:S3-17-military
    <<hang_up "military">>
<<else>>
    <<if !$thirdwave>>
        <<jump ThirdWave>>
    <<endif>>
<<endonce>>
===

title: ThirdWave
---
<<set $thirdwave = true>>
Military: Our radars have detected a brief pause. #line:S4-01-military
Military: Use this time to recharge soldier! #line:S4-02-military
<<wait  30>>
<<start_wave>>
Military: Hey! They are coming! Be ready! #line:S4-03-military
<<hang_up "military">>
===
